  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Should I Upgrade My Smile From Traditional Dentures To All-On-4® Dental Implants In McLean, VA?\n\n\nDecember 2, 2023\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nTraditional dentures are commonly used when people have lost all or most of their teeth due to dental disease, injury, or age. A traditional denture has a flesh-colored acrylic base, which fits over the patient’s gums, and teeth, which are usually made of acrylic or porcelain material. When people no longer want, or no longer can, wear traditional dentures, then they should upgrade their smile to All-On-4® dental implants in McLean, VA.\n\nInterested in learning more about why people should upgrade their smile from traditional dentures to all-On-4 dental implants? Continue reading to learn more about why people should upgrade their smile to All-On-4 dental implants.\n\n\n## The Reasons Why You Should Upgrade Your Smile From Traditional Dentures To All-On-4 Dental Implants In McLean, VA\n\n\nAll-On-4 dental implants offer a host of advantages over traditional dentures. Here are the specific reasons why people should upgrade their smile from traditional dentures to All-On-4 dental implants.\n\n\n### Permanent Full Arch Tooth Replacement Option:\n\n\nAll-On-4 dental implants should replace traditional dentures because they are a permanent full arch tooth replacement option. Traditional dentures are made to just sit on the patients gums and do not become a permanent part of their smile. The prosthesis for All-On-4 implants, on the other hand, are fixed to the patients mouth with four dental implant posts.\n\nWhen placed in the patient’s jawbone, the dental implant posts fuse with the jawbone in a process called osseointegration. After the dental implant posts have fully fused with the jawbone, they become a permanent part of the patients smile. Once the prosthesis is attached to the dental implants, patients will have a beautiful and long-lasting new smile.\n\n\n### Give Patients A Beautiful New Smile:\n\n\nIn terms of aesthetic beauty, All-On-4 dental implants give patients a better-looking new smile than traditional dentures. This is because the color, shape, and size of the full arch prosthesis is custom made to look natural looking and aesthetically enhance the patient’s smile. Traditional dentures, on the other hand, are bulky and will not give patients a natural and better-looking new smile.\n\n\n### Preserves Jawbone Density:\n\n\nUnlike traditional dentures, All-On-4 dental implants preserve the patients jawbone density. This is because the dental implant posts, in an All-On-4 dental implant procedure, stimulate the patients jawbone once they have been permanently placed in it. This stimulation regenerates jawbone density, giving patients a strong and healthy new smile that they can depend on to live their life normally.\n\n\n### Are Cost-effective:\n\n\nAll-On-4 dental implants are a more cost-effective full arch tooth replacement option than traditional dentures. Although the upfront cost of traditional dentures might be lower than All-On-4 dental implants, the maintenance and replacement costs that come with traditional dentures can add up over time.\n\nOn the other hand, with proper care and regular dental check-ups, All-On-4 implants can last a lifetime, making them a worthwhile full arch tooth replacement option.\n\n\n### Gives A New Smile In One Day:\n\n\nFor All-On-4 dental implant procedures, when the dental implant posts have been securely placed in the patient’s jawbone, the temporary prosthesis can be attached to them in the same surgical appointment. The temporary prosthesis is what allows patients to get a brand-new smile in one day. This is a stark contrast to traditional dentures, which may require several fittings and adjustments over a span of weeks or months.\n\nFor individuals who have experienced significant tooth loss, the decision to upgrade from traditional dentures to All-On-4 dental implants can be life-changing. Not only do All-On-4 dental implants offer superior comfort, functionality, and aesthetics to traditional dentures, they also contribute to better oral health and overall quality of life for the patient.\n\n\n## See Us Now So We Can Upgrade Your Smile To All-On-4 Dental Implants\n\n\nAre you ready to replace your traditional dentures with proven and predictable All-On-4 dental implants? When you come to our caring and advanced office, we use the latest techniques and technologies to restore your smile with All-On-4 dental implants. Don’t wait to improve your smile with us. Get in contact with our doctors, Dr. Esam Nahlah and our exceptional team at our office to schedule an appointment today!\n\nPrevPreviousReady To Learn How Full Mouth Dental Implants Are Cost-Effective?\n\nNextAre There Side Effects To Dental Implant Procedures?Next\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Unlock the Benefits of Dental Implants: Your Best Teeth Replacement Option\n\n\nTooth loss can become an unfortunate reality for many as we age. Thankfully, advancements in dental technology, like dental implants,\n\nRead More »\n\nOctober 26, 2024\n\n\n### Your Comprehensive Guide on Dental Implants: The Best Replacement of Tooth Solution\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA are small, and titanium posts are surgically placed in your jawbone underneath your gum line.\n\nOctober 20, 2024\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
